  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An overall objective of the cooperation between the three partners (SFA, SLU, VN Foresty) is to build a solid PDC relationship which will constitute a foundation for providing forecast and analysis approaches for application in Vietnam.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l f&#xf6;r samarbetet mellan de tre parterna (SFA, SLU, VN Foresty) &#xe4;r att bygga en solid Akt&#xf6;rssamverkan-relation som kommer att utg&#xf6;ra en grund f&#xf6;r att ge prognos- och analysmetoder f&#xf6;r till&#xe4;mpning i Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
